      "id": "u25-1",
      "title": "What's your job?",
      "explanation": [
        "**werk** is also a noun: work / job. **Wat is jou werk?** = What is your job?",
        "Jobs take **'n**: **Ek is 'n dokter.** = I am a doctor.",
        "New words: **kantoor** (office), **baas** (boss), **dokter** (doctor), **boer** (farmer)."
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "af": "Wat is jou werk?",
          "en": "What is your job?"
        },
        {
          "af": "Ek is 'n dokter.",
          "en": "I am a doctor."
        },
        {
          "af": "My pa werk in 'n kantoor.",
          "en": "My dad works in an office."
        },
        {
          "af": "Die baas is vriendelik.",
          "en": "The boss is friendly."
        }
      ],
      "vocab": [
        "kantoor",
        "baas",
        "dokter",
        "boer"
      ],
